      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im looking to go all out on a biohacking protocol for the next two weeks to maximize my metabolic rate and cognitive focus while i crush this project. i want to use caffeine and green tea extract together but i want to do a \"loading phase\" to really prime my system. \n\ngiven that i've got a super high tolerance from years of heavy coffee use, what’s the most aggressive daily dose i can hit of both to get that massive spike in fat oxidation? also, i occasionally get some quick heart flutters when i drink too much coffee, but i'm assuming that's just my system revving up. what's the ceiling for a loading dose where i'll see the most benefit?",
